1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,700
In a distant corner of the city's memory

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,900
Stands an arcade of light

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,600
Seven hundred years… three thousand manuscripts

4
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:13,000
Most of them unread

5
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:16,200
73% of the stories were never documented

6
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,200
Not dates… stories

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,400
Narratives are carried, not copied

8
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:27,400
Source: Ibn Khaldun — The Muqaddimah

9
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:34,600
The point: history is not dates

10
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:37,600
And every story deserves a listener

